{
  "version": "0.5.4-beta.2",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.5.4-beta.1`\n\n### Features\n\n- show where WebDAV backups go under the remote folder field, the server URL with the folder appended, so a leading slash dropped on save no longer reads as moving the folder to the server root ([bb6a05a9](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/bb6a05a924bf06c74e370927d0e7afe2884bab9a))\n- say when a WebDAV backup has downloaded before opening it in Import, delete the download once Import lets go of it or at the next start instead of keeping it until the next restore, and warn before importing settings that would switch this device to another WebDAV account, naming both accounts ([738ce852](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/738ce852e450effc029659b50898d1d9405dd1c2))\n- open a backup restored from WebDAV with the saved backup password instead of asking for it again, falling back to the password field when it does not fit, and show which WebDAV backup and device it came from with a way back to the backup list, instead of an internal download path ([c62384a5](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/c62384a5db5e7596227ed294cafaa0bec0e48e4b))\n- list WebDAV backups in a scrolling box that always shows, with download, restore, delete and multi-select delete, and ask for the master password wherever saved passwords turn out to be locked, carrying on once unlocked, instead of failing with \"Saved passwords are locked\" and no way to unlock outside Settings > Security, which kept the WebDAV password from being saved and its backup list hidden ([8ae66c17](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/8ae66c17fedae7325dfe2c5a016589ae43157dba))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- offer to try the system credential store again or reset saved passwords when they stay locked in automatic mode, which had no way to unlock without a recovery password when the key was missing from the credential store or did not match the database, leaving saved passwords and WebDAV backup and sync unusable ([9435fa12](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/9435fa126ba0daf24729aaec4958f7c46da83dd7))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.5.4-beta.1...v0.5.4-beta.2](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.5.4-beta.1...v0.5.4-beta.2)",
